     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Courtesy formulas",
     "texto": [
      "**Szanowni Państwo** opens a formal letter to a group or to a person whose name we do not know.",
      "**Z poważaniem** is a formal closing equivalent to «yours sincerely»."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Formal request",
     "texto": [
      "**Zwracam się z prośbą o + accusative** presents a request politely.",
      "**Będę wdzięczny za...** is said by a man; a woman writes **będę wdzięczna za...**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
